## Control {{controlId}}: Control and manage physical access devices.

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

{{#if tenantName}}
{{tenantName}} controls and manages physical access devices (e.g., keys, locks, badges, card readers) for facilities where CUI systems are accessed. Access devices are inventoried, issued to authorized personnel only, and recovered upon personnel departure or role change. Lost or stolen access devices are reported immediately and deactivated.
{{/if}}

{{#if approverUPN}}
The designated approver ({{approverUPN}}) authorizes issuance of physical access devices and ensures periodic inventory reconciliation.
{{/if}}

{{#if cloudEnvironment}}
For the {{cloudEnvironment}} cloud infrastructure, physical access device management for data center facilities is handled by Microsoft under their FedRAMP High authorization.
{{/if}}

